  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0. ConfigureStrictId() now dispatches per family — Id<T> → char(26),\n            IdNumber<T> → bigint, IdString<T> → varchar(MaxLength). Prefixes live in\n            the type system and are never stored in the column. The IdConvention consults\n            StrictIdEfCoreRegistry (populated at module init by the StrictId source\n            generator) before falling back to reflection, keeping AOT and trim warnings\n            off the fast path. IdStringValueGenerator removed.",
